# Annex (harrisrehman/App)

State.io-style mobile conquest game. TypeScript + Vite + Capacitor Android.

## Source of truth

- **Default branch:** `main` — all edits land here unless user asks otherwise
- **Repo:** https://github.com/harrisrehman/App
- Pull before editing; push when done so other chats and the owner stay in sync

## Key paths

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/game/engine.ts` | Core simulation |
| `src/game/ai.ts` | Bot AI (easy/medium/hard) |
| `src/game/map.ts` | Base placement |
| `src/game/camera.ts` | Zoom/pan |
| `src/main.ts` | UI, menu, filters, game boot |
| `src/style.css` | In-game + menu styling |
| `index.html` | Shell markup |
| `dist/` | Built bundle — **commit after `npm run build`** (phone Update reads this) |
| `downloads/annex.apk` | Installable APK (refresh after CI or local Gradle build) |
| `android/` | Capacitor native shell |

## Ship workflow (required after gameplay/UI changes)

1. Bump `version` in `package.json` (e.g. `0.5.54` → `0.5.55`)
2. Bump `versionCode` + `versionName` in `android/app/build.gradle`
3. Bump version strings in `index.html` and `downloads/install.html`
4. `npm test && npm run build`
5. Commit **source + `dist/`**; push `main`
6. Phone: tap **Update** in installed app (no reinstall unless native/Android changes)

`UPDATE_SOURCES` in `src/game/config.ts` must point at **`main`**, not old feature branches.

## Do not regress

- Spawn interval 5s; gunner cost 6
- Filter bar: 40×40 All/Gunner/Soldier, bottom-left
- Golden Age menu theme + startup audio
- Easy mode: fewer bases, slower/dumber AI
- Min zoom shows full map (contain fit)

## Local dev

```bash
npm install
npm run dev          # browser, --host for phone on Wi‑Fi
npm run cap:sync     # sync to Android project
npx cap run android -l --forwardPorts   # live reload on device via USB
```

## CI

- **Android APK** workflow on push to `main` — succeeds
- **Pages** workflow often fails — APK + raw GitHub URLs are the install path
